## Attribution

haikode is an independent reimplementation of opencode, written in Python for
Haiku OS. It contains no opencode source code, but its behaviour, prompts,
tool surface and much of its design were derived from studying opencode, and
several prompt texts are adapted from it.

opencode is Copyright (c) SST and is distributed under the MIT License:
https://github.com/sst/opencode

The MIT License above is chosen to match, so that anything derived from
opencode carries the same terms it was given.
